namespace pdg { /**

\var pdg::action_AnimationBlendComplete

\brief eventType_SpriteAnimate action: a Spriter animation blend completed. 

Delivered as pdg::eventType_SpriteAnimate with a pdg::SpriteAnimateEvent payload
when pdg::Sprite::blendToAnimation() or pdg::Sprite::transitionToAnimation()
completes. Register with pdg::Sprite::onAnimationBlendComplete() to receive only
this action. Authored-trigger enablement does not control blend-completion events.

\sa pdg::Sprite::transitionToAnimation
\sa pdg::Sprite::onAnimationBlendComplete
\sa pdg.Sprite.blendToAnimation
\sa pdg.eventType_SpriteAnimate

\ingroup Animation

**/ }